# Context-ignore for Dockerfile.ui (build context = repo root).
#
# REQUIRED: the repo-root .dockerignore excludes `manthan-ui` (it was
# written for the API-only Fly image), which would make this build's
# `COPY manthan-ui/ ./` fail. deploy.sh copies this file over the
# workspace .dockerignore before the UI docker build step; local
# BuildKit builds (Docker 23+ default) pick it up automatically as the
# per-Dockerfile ignore file.

.git
.github
.DS_Store
*.log

# Secrets / local env files (Vite would also read .env.production —
# the deploy bakes config via --build-arg instead).
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Junk
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
manthan-ui/dist

# Not needed by the UI image
agent
manthan-api
coral
vps
docs
